{"id":276110418,"title":"253. koa静态资源部署-错误处理-koa和express区别","summary":"koa-koa部署静态资源的服务器（掌握）","content":"<p>koa-koa部署静态资源的服务器（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783223613544-f8b4f8f0-94f6-41b2-8a72-345ad4a8b866.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783223635925-3ee01ac0-ddf9-43e5-b559-cbd3435bd61f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783223655829-3181997f-2ee1-4770-af32-95b43b0fe7e8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783223951346-9ba20b75-ce51-4b02-bb86-3de9f93f1bea.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>koa-koa响应结果支持的数据类型（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783224231299-31f4580d-237b-41bd-8ce7-25a451dd9092.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783224239570-5eed219b-4a58-45c5-9b89-6cb9717328d3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783224425114-30e891d0-da27-4d09-89ad-bdc91ab76552.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783224405249-2a0de80e-7ba2-46ca-be34-f0dbda7e8b2b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783224413265-960fa4b0-c657-4e13-8951-be7c80ba1248.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783224815869-a26120d7-dbe4-41b1-8a5d-b72b498b84df.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783224805982-450611cc-b437-4a00-93be-9d9177584026.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>koa-koa中错误处理的方案解析（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783225061494-8bce1ace-dbe7-4530-a9da-997db87b7547.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783225069487-0c9b15fb-e706-4358-a1e8-03ae66088d8a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783225583925-f1481f64-c298-41f4-8b05-45614b582832.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783225592821-1a108b9e-6d94-4554-8874-649c9fdfc411.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783225533626-0a21e096-bf39-427a-a577-e4bf1720d64c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783236819708-76c904e7-e5e4-43f1-b1b6-ae11bb703671.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>koa-koa和express区别--设计架构上的区别（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">理解</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783237239591-75ab36c2-97cf-48ce-8c83-bf4d8516f652.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>koa和express区别--koa执行同步代码的顺序（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">理解</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783245066146-e377f30a-8702-4e0e-90e0-feb596eab683.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783246088547-5f7cd141-6edd-4425-9871-7cc497586513.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>执行的顺序<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783246694765-ce48d6cc-0c9e-4cf1-bfda-40d2e79aaa56.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>koa和express区别--koa执行异步代码的顺序（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">理解</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783247058249-05527fea-22b4-4b94-82e4-23d5dbb43c92.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>到next的时候，他不会去等下一个中间件执行的结果，而是执行next的下一个，然后返回上面一个代码步骤。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783247228351-eab1571e-a9d2-4d61-871a-7b100cafb585.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这样的话就会去等待我们的结果之后再去执行其他的了。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783247351234-d247a977-e360-4497-8fed-291edad8b309.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783247451857-3c3aaf2e-7d40-4537-861a-9198f44372f2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783247612123-e3535a6a-8ef2-4d70-9577-6a47f41d854d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>koa和express区别--express执行同步和异步代码的顺序（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">理解</font>）</p>\n<p>express的同步代码执行顺序和koa的是一样的<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783247865478-8e68f62b-1380-4847-be65-8054f2dc9242.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>express异步不会去等待执行结果，</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783248035284-f36f3ff6-745a-48d2-9ae2-d81a496faa19.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>koa的会去等待执行结果</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783247993611-96238f1a-254f-4ec5-aa53-8ea96b73844c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783248259293-2f02be34-14cd-4a29-95e8-cd0207374fb9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们只能在这最后返回结果。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783252811387-76d044b9-5818-48e2-8868-94ffc9e2b69c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>koa和express区别--koa的洋葱模型（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">理解</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783253020361-d3169757-efdf-429b-aae4-a4e2ca963128.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783253144186-53b8e673-1cd6-4575-9d90-e6699a28ff6a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783253287210-b35871af-c7ee-4a40-8959-7e35a830e11e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>底层一定要执行蓝色的代码。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783253515413-a1a7c5ce-4c51-4b21-a0ad-8553d357c06a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783253745441-75ffd2ef-fc56-41a8-b526-3fe96f4a4abb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n","contentFormat":"markdown","source":"yuque","cover":"","category_id":80707835,"category":{"id":80707835,"name":"nodejs","description":""},"created_at":"2026-07-02T06:21:01.000Z","updated_at":"2026-07-05T12:16:26.000Z","view_count":0,"like_count":0,"is_top":0,"is_featured":0,"tags":[],"status":"published","yuqueUrl":"https://www.yuque.com/woyaoyizhishuidajue/hkk7kv/gfxgmg4prw8kwet0","slug":"gfxgmg4prw8kwet0","wordCount":285}